                <pb facs="0130" n="56" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg56"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <p>It is with sentiments of the sincerest regret that the Empress and I have learned
                    the death of your father, the King.</p>
                <p>By his wisdom and high intelligence he had placed himself in the first rank among
                    the sovereigns of Europe. He had always shown so much friendship for me that I
                    deeply deplore his loss.</p>
                <p>I do not doubt your royal highness will follow upon the throne so noble an
                    example, and I shall be always happy to show you my friendship.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>NAPOLEON.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
